.TH AIO-TRAY 1 "August 2026" "aio 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
aio-tray \- aio system tray launcher (pystray)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B aio --tray
.SH DESCRIPTION
Places an icon in the system tray. Each
.B Launch
item spawns a fresh aio process
.RB ( _spawn_mode )
running the selected interface, so every mode is independent and can be
quit without affecting the tray.
.SH MENU
.TP
.B Launch CLI
Spawns the default command line interface (catalogue list).
.TP
.B Launch TUI
Spawns the curses interface.
.TP
.B Launch GUI
Spawns the tkinter interface.
.TP
.B Launch WUI
Spawns the web interface on the default port.
.TP
.B Launch Pygame (Alien)
Launches the bundled pygame "aliens" example directly.
.TP
.B Help
Spawns a process that prints the usage text.
.TP
.B Quit
Exits the tray application.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR aio (1),
.BR aio-gui (1),
.BR aio-suite (7)
.SH AUTHOR
Jimmy + opencode
